1. Definitions

1. "Software": the source code, build artifacts and copies of the
   dsh-enterprise-gateway (enterprise gateway) or dsh-enterprise (client plugin)
   project distributed with this license, including your modifications.
2. "Organization": any legal entity, unincorporated organization, government
   body, institution, non-profit or other entity.
3. "Organization size": the total number of the organization's personnel,
   including full-time, part-time, intern, outsourced and dispatched staff,
   measured by the largest headcount on record within the most recent calendar
   month; affiliated entities under common control are counted together.
   A natural person using the Software personally counts as 1.

2. Grant

1. Free grant: organizations with 30 or fewer persons, and individuals, may
   use, copy, modify and internally deploy the Software free of charge.
2. Commercial license: an organization with more than 30 persons shall obtain
   a commercial license from the copyright holder before installing or using
   the Software. Fees and terms are subject to separate agreement;
   contact: mafeis@gmail.com.
3. Grace period: where headcount growth causes the organization size to exceed
   30 for the first time, no breach occurs if a commercial license is obtained
   within 30 days from the day of exceeding.
4. Redistribution: you may redistribute unmodified copies of the Software
   provided this license text and the copyright notice are retained in full.
   Redistribution with the notices removed or altered, or offering products or
   services (including hosting, resale, OEM) based on the Software, requires
   prior written permission from the copyright holder.
5. Modified versions: modified versions are for your organization's internal
   use only and remain subject to the same free-grant or commercial-license
   conditions as the original.
6. Notices: you may not remove or obscure any copyright notice or license
   marking contained in the Software, in whatever form it is distributed.

